  "correct_answer": "A",
  "solution_steps": [
    "Convertimos la ecuación logarítmica a forma exponencial: $\\log_a(M) = N \\iff M = a^N$.",
    "$2x - 1 = 3^2 \\implies 2x - 1 = 9$.",
    "Sumando 1: $2x = 10 \\implies x = 5$."
